\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. I love to hear the story
\par Which angel voices tell,
\par How once the King of Glory
\par Came down on earth to dwell.
\par I am both weak and sinful,
\par But this I surely know:
\par The Lord came down to save me,
\par Because He loved me so.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. I'm glad my blessed Saviour
\par Was once a child like me,
\par To show how pure and holy
\par His little once might be;
\par And if I try to follow
\par His footsteps here below,
\par He never will forsake me,
\par Because He loves me so.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. To sing His love and mercy
\par My sweetest song I'll raise;
\par And though I cannot see Him,
\par I know He hears my praise:
\par For He has kindly promised 
\par That even I may go
\par To sing among His angels,
\par Because He loves me so.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

